exports[`spine tone × edge type voice matrix > tone=astronomy: spine prose reads in tone voice 1`] = `
{
  "body0": "The boundary condition nobody can renegotiate: False sensor returns does not negotiate and does not stop. The false sensor returns versus Custos Echo-58 Belt IV Charter is the headline; the secular decline in conditions at Custos Echo-58 Belt IV is the data. The residual no published account explains: corporate records were altered. Every model of the dispute shares one input: both sides armed their inspectors in the same quarter. The system has entered sustained-conflict operations by every measurable proxy. The principals are Gamma Ledger Trust and Tau Reticuli Cohort; the measurable damage accumulates at the derelict fleet cluster. Recruiters from both sides work the same ration queue, one table apart. Instruments at Gamma Ledger Trust record the dispute between the derelict fleet cluster and Tau Reticuli Cohort as a rising baseline of scarcity: the freight surcharge that lands on them no matter who wins. Reduced to observables, the driver is this — the safety margins were drawn before Derelict fleet cluster started moving. Longshore crews demand danger pay in scrip that clears the same day. Seismic and thermal baselines for Custos Echo-58 Belt IV are extrapolated from Custos Echo-58 Belt IV Charter's single-point coverage.",
  "spineEdgeType": "DESTABILIZES",
  "spineSummary": "The perturbation from the false sensor returns now exceeds Custos Echo-58 Belt IV Charter's tolerance margin.",
}
`;

exports[`spine tone × edge type voice matrix > tone=balanced: spine prose reads in tone voice 1`] = `
{
  "body0": "Granite Reach Water Concession wants the authority to declare what counts as contaminated; Iron Compact Freight Guild guards the margin that keeps the lights on; Kestrel-Locke Salvage Concern gets rationed air while the principals negotiate. Underneath it runs a complication nobody prices openly: Granite Reach Water Concession turned on Iron Compact Freight Guild in the bleed years. The arbitration hall stands empty; its clerks now work security rotations. Strip away the filings and the cause is plain — the safety margins were drawn before Derelict fleet cluster started moving. The derelict fleet cluster presses, Danfeng's Flare Belt III holds, and Danfeng's Flare Belt III Cylinder pays for both: family on both sides of the picket line. Evacuation lighters hold at ready-station through every work shift. The principals are the first-wave ghost colony and Danfeng's Flare Belt III; the casualty ledger, so far, is kept at Danfeng's Flare Belt III Cylinder. And there is the part no one says at the negotiating table: the quarantine is political. Prices quoted to the first-wave ghost colony and Danfeng's Flare Belt III differ by a margin every vendor denies. Danfeng's Flare Belt III carries Danfeng's Flare Belt III Cylinder on its surface.",
  "spineEdgeType": "CONTESTS",
  "spineSummary": "The compact between Granite Reach Water Concession and Iron Compact Freight Guild broke in the bleed years, Everything else in this system is priced against the quarrel between the two of them.",
}
`;

exports[`spine tone × edge type voice matrix > tone=cinematic: spine prose reads in tone voice 1`] = `
{
  "body0": "The fuse is lit at both ends and burning politely. The trojan megaswarm wants the right to set tariffs no one else can audit. Calvera-10 IV wants tomorrow. Calvera-10 IV - Moon I Hold wants the freight surcharge to stop climbing. Longshore crews demand danger pay in scrip that clears the same day. Nobody pretends anymore; the boundary lines get repainted in daylight. Crown of Dust Pact built something worth taking, and Carrion Synod does the taking in this system. The public channel carries two incompatible traffic advisories for the same lane. The shortage memorial is a single empty tank, left ungauged on purpose. The phase-stable superconductive lattice sharpens, Calvera-10 IV - Moon I Hold braces, and Calvera-10 V Platform learns to sleep in a pressure suit. What is left is wreckage with paperwork attached. At night the lights of Calvera-10 IV - Moon I Hold are the only argument that Calvera-10 IV belongs to anyone. There, Calvera-10 V Platform prays to whatever keeps Phase-stable superconductive lattice flowing, and its prayers are itemized.",
  "spineEdgeType": "DESTABILIZES",
  "spineSummary": "The trojan megaswarm is hunting Calvera-10 IV a degree at a time.",
}
